---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro'
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro'
import Header from '../components/Header.astro'
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead
      title="About"
      description="About Madhurjya Roy, a backend and platform engineer who writes about technology and whatever else is on his mind."
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main>
      <section>
        <h1>About</h1>
        <p>
          Hi, I’m Madhurjya. I’m a backend and platform engineer with more than
          seven years of experience building distributed systems, event-driven
          architectures, and cloud-native infrastructure.
        </p>
        <p>
          I’ve worked with Go, Python, Java, Kotlin, Lua, TypeScript, and
          JavaScript. I’m particularly interested in Linux, Kubernetes,
          developer tooling, clean abstractions, and systems that remain simple
          under pressure.
        </p>
        <p>
          Outside work, I’m usually tinkering with electronics, building my
          homelab, automating parts of my home, learning languages, travelling,
          listening to rock music, or thinking about cars and bikes.
        </p>
        <p>
          I started this site thinking it would be mostly about technology. It
          turns out I enjoy writing about whatever happens to be on my mind, so
          that’s what lives here.
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
